        <item>
            <title>0.27.3</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:07:58 -0500</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>63</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.27.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[<style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1f;margin:0;padding:2px 4px}h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 6px}ul{margin:0;padding-left:18px}li{margin:0 0 4px}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){body{color:#f5f5f7}}</style><h3>What's new in Keeploop 0.27.3</h3><ul><li>Monitor alerts now name where the match came from, like "Slack monitor" or "Messages monitor", instead of always saying "Mail monitor".</li><li>When your Mac is asleep or offline, the Today card in ChatGPT no longer shows buttons that cannot work until the Mac is back.</li><li>The tool that collects matches for a shared monitor route now tells AI apps that it is not read-only: later reads of that route skip the matches it returned.</li></ul>]]></description>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
